  "body": "Motivated vendors are keen to see this property sold before Christmas, giving you the opportunity to secure a spacious home in a sought-after coastal location and celebrate the New Year in style.\r\n\r\nThis spacious four-bedroom home sits on a generous 941m² (more or less) section, enjoying a tranquil outlook over native greenery at the rear, with Awaruku Bush Reserve just across the road.\r\n\r\nThe upper level is made for gathering, featuring three bedrooms and a light-filled lounge that flows seamlessly into an open-plan kitchen and dining area, then out to a generous covered deck - the perfect spot for long, relaxed barbecues whatever the weather, with a beautiful canopy of native bush providing the backdrop.\r\n\r\nDownstairs offers an additional living area and a bedroom with an ensuite and walk-in wardrobe, providing plenty of flexibility for growing families, teenagers or visiting guests.\r\n\r\nThe fully fenced, bush-clad backyard offers plenty of space for children and pets to play and explore. Ample storage throughout and a triple garage with internal access add to the home's everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nEnjoy peaceful bush walks in Awaruku Bush Reserve just across the road, or take a short drive to Long Bay Beach, Long Bay Regional Park and Torbay Village for coastal relaxation, outdoor adventures and your daily coffee. Perfectly suited for families, this location is zoned for Glamorgan School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College.\r\n\r\nVacant and ready to move in, this home is waiting for its next chapter. Call Ray Luo or David Millington today!\r\n\r\nAgent conjunctionals welcome!",
